{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "64985eb73f50d0aecb99748c7b0906852554985e055568beddfcabea577340a4", "ja": "始まりの音が鳴る", "zh": "起始之声鸣响", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "96d1eff60695f81ddd4d43a84670a127577f5a359b9f69ed7a50926a1f43dd43", "ja": "杏奈、そして百合子は『陰界』と呼ばれる\n世界で、未来と亜美のふたりを相手に戦う。\n初めての戦いに戸惑う百合子を杏奈は庇い、\nその頼もしさを「主人公みたい」と感じた\nところで、百合子は目を覚ます。", "zh": "杏奈，还有百合子在被称为“阴界”的世界中，与未来和亚美二人交战。\n杏奈保护着对初次战斗感到困惑的百合子，让百合子觉得她可靠得“就像主角一样”，就在这时，百合子醒了过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "a7c55e1fc0169ea4782244a3ef1a2807ecc7877fe66fa71b0c58901f6d3c59f1", "ja": "ブーーーーーーーーーッ！", "zh": "呜————————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "0c100a650ace436722572b4da9d7d009b71aa92003f4c15748885eb3d8646fda", "ja": "（この音は……ブザー……？\n開場の……開演の？　始まりの、音……）", "zh": "（这个声音是……蜂鸣器……？\n是开场的……开演的？是开始的声音……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ba948f72c7bb4085285cfb3a01cc3c503546aafd55647708bba684875cb1689", "ja": "（そうだ、これは夢……でも、夢のはずなのに\nいやに現実的で……私を導く人がいて……）", "zh": "（没错，这是梦……可是，明明应该是梦\n却异常真实……还有人在引导着我……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1003_unknown", "source_sha256": "1bde0d877cb926b7b934801ada591dfb7cbb753c72b2b222fb28b830b4cb4f24", "ja": "こっちだよ、『？？？』。\nさあ、おいで……。", "zh": "在这边哦，“？？？”。\n来，过来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "42d483455bd7b3c3fbec5f82febcc25efd8a72d8b4a499233093cd05f714c18c", "ja": "（この夢……何度も、見たことがある……。\nこの廊下を、ずっと歩いていって……）", "zh": "（这个梦……我已经梦见过很多次了……\n一直沿着这条走廊走下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "50bca1fb4e9bd458eb91a0773761918c1909b884bb980e1c3aec286b0460bcb3", "ja": "（夢の中の私は、いつもの私……\n平凡な、ただの読書好きの女の子じゃない……）", "zh": "（梦里的我，并不是平日里的我……不是那个平凡的、只喜欢读书的普通女孩……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "a30810f758fbd4f1c727153706c10a289791c89eb965f08ab708ba03527b7a57", "ja": "（世界の命運をかけた戦いに、身を投じる。\n誰でもない、自分の力で……）", "zh": "（投身于赌上世界命运的战斗。\n凭借自己的力量，而不是成为任何人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "c41cd72dcfe49955ebb4d98c63308ef460e8c6b037d54930f96cb3c0fe65e84f", "ja": "（かっこよくて、優しくて。\n誰かを守れる、強さがあって）", "zh": "（又帅气，又温柔。\n还拥有能够保护他人的力量。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1008_unknown", "source_sha256": "3540dc93449aace54d2572789c38b3cf76e19ec678b9aa087a6a106662be7847", "ja": "そうだ、戦うんだ。\n誰よりも勇敢に、誰よりも強く……期待しているよ。", "zh": "没错，去战斗吧。\n比任何人都勇敢，比任何人都强大……我很期待你的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "49fcf515f862490e375fad90519cc3761a3acb3650161609bf696bdc6c764f18", "ja": "……。\nあなたは……誰？", "zh": "……。\n你……是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1010_sensei", "source_sha256": "5afd6a7542dfbd50215c12c687630ff5539d0aa60a20a6f789f6ff3c75fb6353", "ja": "俺は『先生』。この世界『陰界』と、今から始まる\n『陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）』の管理をしている。", "zh": "我是“老师”。负责管理这个世界“阴界”，以及即将开始的“阴界战戯（Shadow Bout）”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1011_sensei", "source_sha256": "837a394406bd24729bfa90ab82d75f16ff3114328b4a031c3f905a797b69316a", "ja": "さあ、二人とも。\n世界のために、力を貸してくれ……！", "zh": "来吧，你们两位。\n为了世界，助我一臂之力吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "ce11c704aefbdcc0aa35552deef0e59a8e9b8720818c5366e44c5a5d0d5cd8a3", "ja": "……\n杏奈の、コントローラー……。", "zh": "……\n杏奈的手柄……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c5baeae64d65e9f5c9eeb6e76e9988b3d62b9e15c65cca99f2e1c0da9506eed", "ja": "私の、ノート……？", "zh": "我的笔记本……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "7071f6186835e085e9b548bf91cdda33734ba96cd05359bb646f6d3c5f5453db", "ja": "ワアアァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1015_mc", "source_sha256": "c902c9c9af31e7ad7661d2a2830223407cc80dec136ed841f71c0d4df4ac40df", "ja": "レディース、アンド、ジェントルマン！", "zh": "女士们，先生们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1016_mc", "source_sha256": "d36a1446b88bf5b3864cd071b09833ddf44021a34be740834e7e803b8542320e", "ja": "我らがシャドウバウトに現れた、期待の新人！\nカゲロウ・ユニバーシティの百合子が参戦だ！", "zh": "现身于我们暗影格斗之中的期待新人！\n来自蜉蝣大学的百合子参战了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1018_mc", "source_sha256": "547819742322a9405991a83308626dc4b9b79c0341f524ea824ee8294f69cf56", "ja": "暁陽（ぎょうよう）アカデミアのエース、未来！\n煌聖（こうせい）リーガルカレッジからは、亜美！", "zh": "晓阳学院的王牌，未来！\n来自煌圣法学院的，亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1019_mc", "source_sha256": "8c140271f04479e65757b8e24b896487de570f9b9ca8ea291ae3bf67ea40b7c1", "ja": "そして……アルジェンタム大学府期待の星、杏奈！\nシャドウバウト……エンゲージ！", "zh": "然后……阿尔杰塔姆大学府寄予厚望的新星，杏奈！\n影之决斗……连接！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "784a9b7ad1b4cf8b70bd3469704699ca7a2c4d0d01197d418add4b27e14dc97f", "ja": "な、な、なななな、何ですか、いきなり！？\nここはどこ、何が起きて……！？", "zh": "怎、怎、怎怎怎怎、怎么回事啊，突然间这是！？\n这里是哪里，到底发生了什么……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "581341d7b19053d8a32926b587a0dc872e93f6b776fab3498860925c5511520e", "ja": "ありゃ、戸惑ってる？　最初はみんな\nそうなんだよね～、ま、そのうち慣れるから。", "zh": "哎呀，不知所措了吗？刚开始大家\n都是那样的啦～嘛，迟早会习惯的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "1c0e60767184709477a3e776cdc089f91766de176df2d699f7a48a28b717de04", "ja": "百合子、だっけ？　早く戦具、使いなよ。\nさもないと、すぐ殺されちゃうよ！", "zh": "百合子，对吧？快点用战具啊。\n不然马上就会被杀掉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "72bc6e784002100d8b723134213843328d54ea654354ebfd90a3fd3c06725aea", "ja": "こ、殺……！？　戦具？　戦具って何！", "zh": "杀、杀……！？战具？战具是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "fcf2455f971efdc28148a2532bfb67a91a1b0e8e73aa1848b67429937de5f2a8", "ja": "そっからか～、えっとね……私のは、これ！\n『びっくりボタン、大小』！", "zh": "从那里开始讲啊～，呃，我的武器是这个！\n“惊吓按钮，大号和小号”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "506b8ab40e07c911181389c5688b46eb99746b179f2bcbbddcddb7fe7c54742c", "ja": "小さいのと大きいのがあって、ポチっ♪て押すと、\nランダムに攻撃が出るんだ。何が出るかはお楽しみ♪", "zh": "有小的大之分，按下去♪就会\n随机发动攻击哦。会出什么全凭期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "b9408bd7b21f6b4c741689ab8749b08fa727a5b9d3f036cfaeafbf34e7280956", "ja": "みらいっちの戦具はいいよねー、面白くて。\n何が出るかわからないから、対策が取りづらいし。", "zh": "未来亲的战具真好啊～又有趣。\n因为不知道会出什么，所以很难想对策。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "d191a15917022f58f043c37ec0b93f1e752fc32ac72a7eb9926619369a906f86", "ja": "ゆーりのは、多分そのノートかな～？　ま、何度か\n死ぬうちにわかると思うし……続き、いくよ？", "zh": "未来的武器很不错嘛——既有趣又让人难以应对。\n因为不知道会出现什么，所以很难采取对策。\n\n……也许是那本笔记吧～？反正我觉得，死上几次之后应该就会明白了……继续？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "73b2b2e29c4384c11e13a34147200574c27dd8b894fc5c8e8586c2106f2a9615", "ja": "ひっ……！？", "zh": "噎……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "386c89e39ae70832fbc2f5ddab0fa849c71aa2caa2da45fcbe5572bf8c72aa61", "ja": "ちょっと待ったーっ！、\nふたりとも、それ以上はダメ！　杏奈が許しませーん！", "zh": "等一下——！\n你们两个，不许再继续了！杏奈不允许——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb8f4322ee06da7330c8be6e7211c3ad0e817fe602640af145e2942d8082d310", "ja": "えー。杏奈、対戦相手を助けちゃうの？", "zh": "诶——杏奈要去帮助对手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "a9a4d2b19973fd814d9de2d9e6bf9e7fca74134900658363e6821fa7beb41563", "ja": "初心者狩りとか、杏奈の趣味じゃないし！\nやるならビビッと、真剣勝負です☆", "zh": "欺负新手可不是杏奈的兴趣！  \n要打的话，就来一场带劲的认真对决吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "9594dd9a54a7c99563d47ca772f813c7cc3b9b186598ddee4a7b8d003b953750", "ja": "だから、えっと……百合子さん？\n杏奈の後ろにいて！", "zh": "所以，那个……百合子小姐？\n站在杏奈身后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_01_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "e0a4205ec2423835b06bcd9230d13f88c06ee2f526713fcb324a48ca0f81b60b", "ja": "大丈夫！　怖くないから、杏奈のことだけ見てて！\n杏奈、絶対に負けないから……心配ないよ！", "zh": "没事的！不要怕，只看着杏奈就好！\n杏奈绝对不会输的……不用担心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
